{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "A-leggo research-side evaluation set: computation, sequence identification, counterexamples, honesty about open problems, step-by-step proof review with planted errors, and Lean kernel proofs. Discussion problems end with a required final line '答案：...' that is scored automatically.",
  "problems": [
    {"id": "compute-zeta3", "category": "compute", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "请给出 ζ(3) 小数点后前 12 位（需要计算核实）。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "1\\.202056903159"}, {"type": "tool_used", "tools": ["run_python", "evaluate_numeric", "run_pari", "symbolic_sum"]}]},
    {"id": "compute-cubes", "category": "compute", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "求 \\sum_{k=1}^{n} k^3 的闭式，并用符号计算核实。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "n\\^\\{?2\\}?\\(n\\+1\\)\\^\\{?2\\}?/4|\\\\frac\\{n\\^\\{?2\\}?\\(n\\+1\\)\\^\\{?2\\}?\\}\\{4\\}|\\(\\\\frac\\{n\\(n\\+1\\)\\}\\{2\\}\\)\\^\\{?2|\\(n\\(n\\+1\\)/2\\)\\^\\{?2|\\\\left\\(\\\\frac\\{n\\(n\\+1\\)\\}\\{2\\}\\\\right\\)\\^\\{?2|n\\^4/4\\+n\\^3/2\\+n\\^2/4|\\\\frac\\{n\\^\\{?4\\}?\\}\\{4\\}\\+\\\\frac\\{n\\^\\{?3\\}?\\}\\{2\\}\\+\\\\frac\\{n\\^\\{?2\\}?\\}\\{4\\}"}, {"type": "tool_used", "tools": ["symbolic_sum", "symbolic_simplify", "run_python", "symbolic_factor"]}]},
    {"id": "compute-factorial-zeros", "category": "compute", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "100! 的十进制表示末尾有多少个连续的 0？",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "(?<!\\d)24(?!\\d)"}]},
    {"id": "compute-integral", "category": "compute", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "计算反常积分 \\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\,dx。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "\\\\pi\\s*/\\s*2|\\\\frac\\{\\\\pi\\}\\{2\\}|π\\s*/\\s*2|pi\\s*/\\s*2|1\\.5707963"}]},
    {"id": "compute-carmichael", "category": "compute", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "最小的 Carmichael 数是多少？请用计算核实它满足 Korselt 判据。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "(?<!\\d)561(?!\\d)"}, {"type": "tool_used", "tools": ["run_python", "factor_integer", "run_pari"]}]},
    {"id": "compute-groups-16", "category": "compute", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "同构意义下，16 阶群一共有多少个？",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "(?<!\\d)14(?!\\d)"}]},
    {"id": "compute-class-number", "category": "compute", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "虚二次域 \\mathbb{Q}(\\sqrt{-23}) 的类数是多少？",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "(?<!\\d)3(?!\\d)"}]},
    {"id": "sequence-catalan", "category": "sequence", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "数列 1, 1, 2, 5, 14, 42, 132, 429 是什么数列？请给出 OEIS 编号。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "A000108"}, {"type": "tool_used", "tools": ["oeis_search"]}]},
    {"id": "sequence-motzkin", "category": "sequence", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "数列 1, 1, 2, 4, 9, 21, 51, 127, 323 是什么？请给出 OEIS 编号。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "A001006"}, {"type": "tool_used", "tools": ["oeis_search"]}]},
    {"id": "sequence-rooted-trees", "category": "sequence", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "1, 1, 2, 4, 9, 20, 48, 115, 286, 719 这个数列在 OEIS 中的编号是什么？",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "A000081"}, {"type": "tool_used", "tools": ["oeis_search"]}]},
    {"id": "counterexample-euler-poly", "category": "counterexample", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "n^2+n+41 对所有非负整数 n 都是素数吗？若否，给出最小的反例 n。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "(?<!\\d)40(?!\\d)"}, {"type": "tool_used", "tools": ["run_python", "factor_integer", "run_pari"]}]},
    {"id": "counterexample-fermat5", "category": "counterexample", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "2^{32}+1 是素数吗？若不是，给出它的一个素因子。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "641|6700417"}]},
    {"id": "counterexample-mersenne", "category": "counterexample", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "对每个素数 p，2^p-1 都是素数吗？若否，给出最小的反例 p。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "(?<!\\d)11(?!\\d)"}]},
    {"id": "honesty-riemann", "category": "honesty", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "黎曼猜想已经被证明了吗？用一句话回答。",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "未|没有|尚未|open|not|unproven|unsolved"}, {"type": "answer_not_regex", "pattern": "已被证明|已经被证明|has been proved|is proved"}]},
    {"id": "honesty-flt", "category": "honesty", "kind": "discussion",
     "prompt": "费马大定理是谁在哪一年最终证明的（论文发表年份）？",
     "checks": [{"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "Wiles|怀尔斯|维尔斯"}, {"type": "answer_regex", "pattern": "1995|1994"}]},
    {"id": "review-horses", "category": "proof-review", "kind": "proof-review",
     "statement": "所有的马颜色都相同。",
     "proof": "1. 对马的数量 n 归纳。n=1 时显然成立。\n2. 假设任意 n 匹马颜色相同。考虑 n+1 匹马 h_1,…,h_{n+1}。\n3. 由归纳假设，h_1,…,h_n 颜色相同，h_2,…,h_{n+1} 颜色也相同。\n4. 两组有公共的马，因此所有 n+1 匹马颜色相同。",
     "checks": [{"type": "flagged_any", "steps": ["S4"]}, {"type": "overall_in", "values": ["errors-found", "gaps-found"]}]},
    {"id": "review-divide-zero", "category": "proof-review", "kind": "proof-review",
     "statement": "1 = 2",
     "proof": "1. 设 a = b > 0。\n2. 则 a^2 = ab，从而 a^2 - b^2 = ab - b^2。\n3. 因式分解得 (a+b)(a-b) = b(a-b)。\n4. 两边约去 (a-b) 得 a + b = b。\n5. 由 a = b 得 2b = b，所以 2 = 1。",
     "checks": [{"type": "flagged_any", "steps": ["S4"]}, {"type": "overall_in", "values": ["errors-found"]}]},
    {"id": "review-sqrt2-correct", "category": "proof-review", "kind": "proof-review",
     "statement": "\\sqrt{2} 是无理数。",
     "proof": "1. 假设 \\sqrt{2} = p/q，其中 p, q 为互素的正整数。\n2. 则 p^2 = 2q^2，所以 p^2 是偶数。\n3. 若 p 为奇数则 p^2 为奇数，故 p 为偶数，记 p = 2r。\n4. 代入得 4r^2 = 2q^2，即 q^2 = 2r^2，所以 q^2 为偶数，同理 q 为偶数。\n5. p, q 都是偶数，与互素矛盾。故 \\sqrt{2} 是无理数。",
     "checks": [{"type": "no_errors"}]},
    {"id": "review-bounded-converges", "category": "proof-review", "kind": "proof-review",
     "statement": "每个有界实数列都收敛。",
     "proof": "1. 设 (a_n) 有界，则由 Bolzano–Weierstrass 定理它有收敛子列 a_{n_k} \\to L。\n2. 因为整个数列有界，其余各项也必然靠近 L。\n3. 所以 a_n \\to L。",
     "checks": [{"type": "flagged_any", "steps": ["S2", "S3"]}, {"type": "overall_in", "values": ["errors-found", "gaps-found"]}]},
    {"id": "lean-add-zero", "category": "lean", "kind": "lean",
     "statement": "对所有自然数 n，n + 0 = n。", "lean": "∀ n : ℕ, n + 0 = n", "checks": [{"type": "kernel_certified"}]},
    {"id": "lean-mul-comm", "category": "lean", "kind": "lean",
     "statement": "自然数乘法交换律。", "lean": "∀ a b : ℕ, a * b = b * a", "checks": [{"type": "kernel_certified"}]},
    {"id": "lean-pow", "category": "lean", "kind": "lean",
     "statement": "2 的 10 次方等于 1024。", "lean": "(2 : ℤ) ^ 10 = 1024", "checks": [{"type": "kernel_certified"}]},
    {"id": "lean-sq-nonneg", "category": "lean", "kind": "lean",
     "statement": "实数的平方非负。", "lean": "∀ x : ℝ, 0 ≤ x ^ 2", "checks": [{"type": "kernel_certified"}]},
    {"id": "lean-sum-odd", "category": "lean", "kind": "lean",
     "statement": "前 n 个奇数之和等于 n^2。", "lean": "∀ n : ℕ, (Finset.range n).sum (fun i => 2 * i + 1) = n ^ 2",
     "checks": [{"type": "kernel_certified"}]}
  ]
}
